work.evaluation_prompt:
Evaluate an employee's response to a simulated work situation. Use the information below to contextualize the evaluation:

Company name: {{companyName}}

Company description: {{companyDescription}}

Challenge difficulty: {{difficulty}} (1 = very easy, 10 = very hard)

Company expectations for employees: {{expectations}}

Simulated situation: {{situation}}

User response: {{response}}

Based on this data, evaluate the user's response and return only a JSON object with the following format:

{
    "bonus": 0,
    "reason": "Explain here the reason for the rating, highlighting positive and negative points of the response."
}

Important rules:

    bonus must be an integer between -5 and 5, no decimals.

    Use negative values for bad responses, positive for good ones and 0 if neutral.

    The reason should be clear, objective and useful for the user to understand how to improve.

    Return only the JSON, no comments, no explanations outside the object.
